<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Herat AOI - NISAR active farmland</name>
    <description>Area of interest for the OFFBEAT project, NASA Space Apps 2026, challenge: Dancing with the SARs.
Not hand drawn. These outlines are derived from NISAR L-band GCOV data, Path 70 Frame 19 ascending, three dates in the 2026 season, 50 m cells. They enclose the ground whose radar backscatter changed most across the season, which is where irrigated cropping is most likely. Total about 445 square kilometres.
Data: NASA/ISRO NISAR, PROVISIONAL products via the Alaska Satellite Facility.</description>
    <Style id="aoi">
      <LineStyle><color>ff00ffff</color><width>3</width></LineStyle>
      <PolyStyle><color>4d00ffff</color></PolyStyle>
    </Style>
